—","s":246.44,"e":247.1,"line":73},{"w":"A","s":247.1,"e":247.58,"line":74},{"w":"God","s":247.58,"e":247.76,"line":74},{"w":"who","s":247.76,"e":248.02,"line":74},{"w":"keeps","s":248.02,"e":248.24,"line":74},{"w":"His","s":248.24,"e":248.52,"line":74},{"w":"grace","s":248.52,"e":248.9,"line":74},{"w":"when","s":248.9,"e":249.38,"line":74},{"w":"everything","s":249.38,"e":250.08,"line":74},{"w":"strains.","s":250.08,"e":250.9,"line":74},{"w":"Maybe","s":250.9,"e":252,"line":75},{"w":"prayer","s":252,"e":252.9,"line":75},{"w":"is","s":252.9,"e":254.4,"line":75},{"w":"more","s":254.4,"e":254.72,"line":75},{"w":"than","s":254.72,"e":254.98,"line":75},{"w":"asking","s":254.98,"e":255.42,"line":75},{"w":"to","s":255.42,"e":255.84,"line":75},{"w":"be","s":255.84,"e":256.26,"line":75},{"w":"saved.","s":256.26,"e":257.26,"line":75},{"w":"Maybe","s":257.9,"e":258.6,"line":76},{"w":"sometimes","s":258.6,"e":259.22,"line":76},{"w":"prayer","s":259.22,"e":259.46,"line":76},{"w":"says:","s":259.46,"e":260.36,"line":76},{"w":"“Remember","s":260.7,"e":261.98,"line":77},{"w":"what","s":261.98,"e":262.46,"line":77},{"w":"You","s":262.46,"e":262.78,"line":77},{"w":"taught","s":262.78,"e":263.56,"line":77},{"w":"us—","s":263.56,"e":264.2,"line":77},{"w":"and","s":264.9,"e":265.66,"line":78},{"w":"we’ll","s":265.66,"e":265.82,"line":78},{"w":"remember","s":265.98,"e":266.54,"line":78},{"w":"too.”","s":266.54,"e":267.18,"line":78},{"w":"Grace","s":267.66,"e":268.08,"line":79},{"w":"under","s":268.08,"e":268.82,"line":79},{"w":"pressure.","s":268.82,"e":269.46,"line":79},{"w":"Grace","s":269.54,"e":270.1,"line":80},{"w":"with","s":270.1,"e":270.8,"line":80},{"w":"power.","s":270.8,"e":271.44,"line":80},{"w":"Grace","s":271.44,"e":271.94,"line":81},{"w":"when","s":271.94,"e":272.46,"line":81},{"w":"the","s":272.46,"e":273.02,"line":81},{"w":"whole","s":273.02,"e":273.68,"line":81},{"w":"sky","s":273.68,"e":274.22,"line":81},{"w":"shakes.","s":274.22,"e":274.96,"line":81},{"w":"That’s","s":275.78,"e":276.1,"line":82},{"w":"when","s":276.42,"e":276.64,"line":82},{"w":"grace","s":276.64,"e":277.18,"line":82},{"w":"becomes","s":277.18,"e":278.84,"line":82},{"w":"grace.","s":278.84,"e":279.62,"line":82}],"lines":[{"s":0,"e":0.5,"text":"**[Intro — Male Lead, sparse piano]**"},{"s":1.8,"e":5.96,"text":"If Heaven’s holy, why it feel like martial law?"},{"s":8.14,"e":11.78,"text":"Why mercy disappear the minute pressure calls?"},{"s":12.68,"e":18.6,"text":"I’m not asking for a throne, I’m asking what I saw—"},{"s":20.38,"e":26.22,"text":"If power means perfection, then perfection needs a pause."},{"s":41.56,"e":45.58,"text":"You taught us turn the cheek, tell truth, forgive,"},{"s":45.84,"e":49.3,"text":"Leave room for every wounded soul to live."},{"s":49.22,"e":53.04,"text":"But when the stakes rise high and the sirens start,"},{"s":53.04,"e":56.14,"text":"Does Heaven trade its halo for a harder heart?"},{"s":56.78,"e":60.32,"text":"Orders from above, everybody fall in line,"},{"s":60.68,"e":64.6,"text":"Sacred surveillance like the stars became the signs."},{"s":64.6,"e":67.94,"text":"Fear dressed as faith, force dressed as fate,"},{"s":67.94,"e":71.58,"text":"“Trust the greater plan” while they’re locking every gate."},{"s":71.58,"e":74.88,"text":"But leadership ain’t domination dressed in white,"},{"s":74.88,"e":78.7,"text":"Grace means keeping grace when you’re terrified at night."},{"s":78.7,"e":82.44,"text":"Anybody can be gentle when the garden’s going great—"},{"s":82.44,"e":86.6,"text":"Character gets counted when catastrophe awaits."},{"s":86.6,"e":87.1,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus — Female Vocal, piano rising]**"},{"s":86.8,"e":91.08,"text":"If love is really endless, let it live beneath the strain,"},{"s":91,"e":94.82,"text":"Let mercy keep its meaning when the whole sky screams in pain."},{"s":94.74,"e":98.52,"text":"We learned the lesson Heaven gave—now Heaven, do the same:"},{"s":98.52,"e":102.26,"text":"Power without compassion only magnifies the flame."},{"s":102.26,"e":105.12,"text":"Maybe we can teach God grace,"},{"s":105.12,"e":108.44,"text":"Not with hate, but face to face."},{"s":108.44,"e":111.76,"text":"If Heaven feels like martial law,"},{"s":111.76,"e":118.28,"text":"Let love repeal the fear in all."},{"s":118.28,"e":120.1,"text":"Because half this world looks close to hell—"},{"s":120.08,"e":122.04,"text":"Children under bombs and shells,"},{"s":122.04,"e":124.02,"text":"Families erased, whole cities scarred—"},{"s":124.02,"e":125.94,"text":"How can “great” look this damn hard?"},{"s":126,"e":128.12,"text":"If You’re greater, then be greater still,"},{"s":128.12,"e":130.5,"text":"Choose mercy when You could choose will."},{"s":130.5,"e":133.96,"text":"No crown should make compassion small—"},{"s":134.3,"e":137.64,"text":"The highest power should love us all."},{"s":137.64,"e":138.14,"text":"**[Verse 2 — Male Lead, harder drums]**"},{"s":137.64,"e":139.92,"text":"Genocide beneath a blue and beautiful sky,"},{"s":140.66,"e":143.76,"text":"Mothers learning names they never should’ve had to cry."},{"s":143.76,"e":147.16,"text":"Mass graves, burned homes, borders drawn in blood,"},{"s":147.08,"e":150.92,"text":"While prayers rise upward through the ash and through the mud."},{"s":150.84,"e":154.04,"text":"So forgive the question if the question comes severe:"},{"s":154.04,"e":157.86,"text":"If God is truly greatness, why’s creation drowning here?"},{"s":158.14,"e":161.66,"text":"Not saying every tragedy was authored by Your hand—"},{"s":161.66,"e":166.38,"text":"I’m saying unexplained suffering deserves more than “understand.”"},{"s":166.38,"e":170.06,"text":"Maybe freedom has a cost, maybe humans make the blade,"},{"s":170.06,"e":173.74,"text":"Maybe Heaven doesn’t cause each evil choice that people make."},{"s":173.74,"e":177.58,"text":"Still, if You can lead the leaders, if You whisper through the dark,"},{"s":177.58,"e":181.86,"text":"Teach restraint before revenge becomes somebody’s sacred spark."},{"s":181.86,"e":182.36,"text":"**[Bridge — Nearly silent, female vocal]**"},{"s":182.76,"e":186.26,"text":"We don’t need perfection proved through punishment."},{"s":186.54,"e":189.64,"text":"We need power brave enough to practice tenderness."},{"s":190.12,"e":191.48,"text":"No manipulation."},{"s":191.74,"e":193.5,"text":"No coercion dressed as care."},{"s":193.5,"e":197.84,"text":"No “greater good” that makes the innocent despair."},{"s":197.84,"e":198.34,"text":"**[Male Lead]**"},{"s":197.84,"e":199.66,"text":"You told us love our enemies."},{"s":199.62,"e":201.08,"text":"We listened."},{"s":201.42,"e":203.94,"text":"You told us mercy triumphs."},{"s":203.94,"e":204.74,"text":"We remembered."},{"s":205.22,"e":208,"text":"You told us pride can poison kings."},{"s":208.32,"e":210.44,"text":"So if Heaven ever trembles—"},{"s":211.5,"e":212.78,"text":"remember too."},{"s":212.78,"e":213.28,"text":"**[Final Chorus — Orchestra, choir, massive drums]**"},{"s":212.98,"e":216.22,"text":"Maybe we can teach God grace,"},{"s":216.22,"e":217.9,"text":"Hold the mirror, hold our place."},{"s":219.7,"e":222.96,"text":"If Heaven feels like martial law,"},{"s":222.96,"e":227.48,"text":"Let mercy be the higher law."},{"s":227.74,"e":230.22,"text":"When half the earth resembles hell,"},{"s":230.22,"e":232.12,"text":"We don’t look away, we break the spell."},{"s":232.04,"e":233.94,"text":"Feed the hungry, stop the guns,"},{"s":233.94,"e":235.52,"text":"Count each stranger as someone."},{"s":235.52,"e":238.14,"text":"If You’re greater, show what greater means:"},{"s":238.14,"e":240,"text":"Less control and cleaner hands,"},{"s":240,"e":243.16,"text":"More forgiveness, fewer demands,"},{"s":243.42,"e":247.1,"text":"Truth without terror, strength without chains—"},{"s":247.1,"e":250.9,"text":"A God who keeps His grace when everything strains."},{"s":250.9,"e":257.26,"text":"Maybe prayer is more than asking to be saved."},{"s":257.9,"e":260.36,"text":"Maybe sometimes prayer says:"},{"s":260.7,"e":264.2,"text":"“Remember what You taught us—"},{"s":264.9,"e":267.18,"text":"and we’ll remember too.”"},{"s":267.66,"e":269.46,"text":"Grace under pressure."},{"s":269.54,"e":271.44,"text":"Grace with power."},{"s":271.44,"e":274.96,"text":"Grace when the whole sky shakes."},{"s":275.78,"e":279.62,"text":"That’s when grace becomes grace."}],"duration":282.44,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-21T00:35:51.789Z","stats":{"whisperWords":574,"polishedWords":555,"matched":537,"matchRate":0.968}}